---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<LegalLayout
    title={`Privacy Policy - ${SITE_TITLE}`}
    description="Privacy Policy for Discord Dashboard - Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data."
>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: February 16, 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
        Welcome to Discord Dashboard ("we," "our," or "us"). We are committed to
        protecting your privacy and ensuring the security of your personal
        information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose,
        and safeguard your information when you use our Discord bot and
        dashboard services.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

    <h3>2.1 Discord User Data</h3>
    <p>When you use our bot, we collect:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Discord User ID, username, and discriminator</li>
        <li>Server (guild) information where the bot is installed</li>
        <li>Message content when interacting with bot commands</li>
        <li>Role and permission data for server management features</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2.2 Dashboard Usage Data</h3>
    <p>When you access our web dashboard, we collect:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>IP address and browser information</li>
        <li>Authentication tokens for Discord OAuth</li>
        <li>Configuration settings and preferences</li>
        <li>Usage statistics and analytics data</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the collected information for:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Providing and maintaining our bot services</li>
        <li>Managing server configurations and settings</li>
        <li>Processing support tickets and moderation actions</li>
        <li>Improving our services and user experience</li>
        <li>Sending important service notifications</li>
        <li>Detecting and preventing abuse or violations</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
    <p>
        We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data.
        Your information is stored on secure servers with encryption at rest and
        in transit. We retain data only as long as necessary to provide our
        services or as required by law.
    </p>

    <h3>4.1 Data Retention</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>
            Active server configurations: Retained while the bot is in your
            server
        </li>
        <li>Ticket data: Retained for 90 days after ticket closure</li>
        <li>Moderation logs: Retained for 1 year</li>
        <li>Analytics data: Aggregated and anonymized after 30 days</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
    <p>
        We do not sell your personal information. We may share data only in
        these circumstances:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>With your explicit consent</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations or court orders</li>
        <li>To protect our rights, safety, or property</li>
        <li>
            With service providers who assist in operating our services (under
            strict confidentiality agreements)
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Access your personal data we hold</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Object to processing of your data</li>
        <li>Export your data in a portable format</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
        Our services are not intended for users under 13 years of age (or 16 in
        the EU). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        If you believe we have collected data from a child, please contact us
        immediately.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you
        of significant changes by posting a notice on our dashboard or through
        Discord. Your continued use of our services after changes constitutes
        acceptance of the updated policy.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your
        rights, please contact us:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Email: privacy@yourdomain.com</li>
        <li>Discord: Join our support server</li>
        <li>Dashboard: Submit a support ticket</li>
    </ul>
</LegalLayout>
